WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.833
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:20.667
<i>Between us half-demon twins, </i>
<i> two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.792 --> 00:00:23.208
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.708
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.125
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:28.833
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.333 --> 00:00:30.750
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:32.500
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:35.542
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.292
<i>A Feudal Fairytale, </i>
<i> Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.542
<i>We'll keep moving forward </i>
<i> through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:46.583
CORPSE DEALER

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:49.667
Lord Riku, I'd like to return this to you.

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:50.792
Are you done with it?

00:00:50.958 --> 00:00:51.833
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU
BOUNTY HUNTERS' AGENT – CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
Yes.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.708
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU
BOUNTY HUNTERS' AGENT – CORPSE DEALER JYUBEI
The Rainbow Pearl has gotten me more bounties,

00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:57.083
and it's allowed me to make big profits.

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:58.250
Is that so?

00:00:58.250 --> 00:00:59.917
That's good to hear.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:04.167
<i>I suppose I should start making my move.</i>

00:01:18.292 --> 00:01:19.458
Here it is.

00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:33.917
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – KONTON

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:40.208
You! Do not step on that.

00:01:40.917 --> 00:01:43.583
Oh my goodness, I am terribly sorry.

00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:49.542
Sir Konton, you sure seem to
be taking your time.

00:01:49.792 --> 00:01:50.708
What did you say?

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:55.875
The Half-Demon Princesses keep defeating you,
and you've barely lifted a finger.

00:01:55.875 --> 00:01:57.125
Are you fine with that?

00:01:59.583 --> 00:02:04.125
This might be beyond your comprehension,
but I am preparing a field right now.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:05.833
A field?

00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:09.583
An eight field escape trap.
It's based on Fang magic.

00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.458
However, I can't decide on the keystone.

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:15.208
It's an affixed focal point for power.

00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:18.750
Do you want to be it?

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.917
Oh no, I'm not strong enough
for the task.

00:02:21.917 --> 00:02:24.875
Perhaps it'd be best
if you fulfilled that role yourself.

00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:27.375
I need to be controlling the field.

00:02:27.667 --> 00:02:30.333
Then, how about Mister Totetsu?

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:32.167
Totetsu, you say?

00:02:33.458 --> 00:02:35.333
That glutton, huh...

00:02:35.792 --> 00:02:38.125
Of Lord Kirinmaru's Four Perils,

00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:41.708
you and Mister Totetsu are
the only ones remaining.

00:02:42.083 --> 00:02:44.542
Why not work together once in a while?

00:02:44.875 --> 00:02:47.583
I don't know where he is or what he's doing.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:52.083
Please, leave that matter to me.
I'll look for him and bring him here.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.875
If you want to bring someone here,
bring the Half-Demon Princesses.

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:59.458
This field is useless
unless someone lures them in.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.333
All right, I'll think of plan for that, too.

00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:06.875
You're being quite generous.

00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:10.042
Lord Kirinmaru's wish
is for the Rainbow Pearls

00:03:10.042 --> 00:03:12.375
to be stolen from the Half-Demon Princesses.

00:03:12.917 --> 00:03:15.750
I hope you haven't forgotten about that.

00:03:16.208 --> 00:03:17.750
I assure you, I haven't.

00:03:20.167 --> 00:03:22.583
Totetsu as the keystone...

00:05:04.292 --> 00:05:05.833
"Trap of the Two Perils."

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.917
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI
What?! This isn't Mount Musubi?

00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:14.792
I heard over at the village
that this is Mount Musubi.

00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:16.875
This is Mount Omusubi.

00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:18.083
<i>Omusubi</i>?

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:19.542
See, look at that.

00:05:20.042 --> 00:05:23.292
Doesn't that mountain look tasty?

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.458
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA
So where's Mount Musubi?

00:05:27.458 --> 00:05:30.125
Never heard of a mountain with that name.

00:05:31.667 --> 00:05:33.250
Are you kidding me...

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:35.833
CAT DEMON – KIRARA

00:05:36.542 --> 00:05:38.542
Such a big misunderstanding.

00:05:38.542 --> 00:05:40.500
You're acting like it's not your problem.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.458
If we don't catch the Dream Butterfly,
we can't get your sleep back.

00:05:44.917 --> 00:05:47.333
I have no issues with that.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.000
Let's start heading back.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:55.708
Dream Butterfly, where the heck are you?

00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:06.625
Two of the Four Perils have been defeated,
and you still won't do anything?

00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:11.667
You were supposed to kill
Sesshomaru's daughters for me.

00:06:11.667 --> 00:06:13.458
Was I?

00:06:13.458 --> 00:06:14.625
Yes, you were.

00:06:14.792 --> 00:06:15.708
BEAST KING RULING THE FOUR PERILS – KIRINMARU

00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:18.125
BEAST KING RULING THE FOUR PERILS – KIRINMARU
Riku seems to be on the move.

00:06:18.708 --> 00:06:20.625
MYSTERIOUS BEAUTIFUL DEMON – ZERO
You're leaving things to him?

00:06:20.625 --> 00:06:24.458
He is my most trusted retainer.
It will be fine.

00:06:24.667 --> 00:06:26.417
Such an indolent person...

00:06:37.625 --> 00:06:40.000
CORPSE DEALER

00:06:44.125 --> 00:06:45.042
Hey.

00:06:45.417 --> 00:06:47.833
There's still some dust here.

00:06:48.042 --> 00:06:49.667
Geez, shut up.

00:06:49.667 --> 00:06:53.708
Mister Jyubei, don't you have
proper bounty hunting jobs for me?

00:06:53.708 --> 00:06:55.208
Clearly, there aren't any.

00:06:55.542 --> 00:07:00.542
YOUNG RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO
Get your hands moving! Or else you won't
even make enough for today's meal.

00:07:00.542 --> 00:07:04.208
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
I can't believe you're using me like this!

00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:06.708
I'm the kind who can
make you loads of money!

00:07:07.042 --> 00:07:09.500
I still think you were just lucky.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.542
Shut up, you little racoon dog.

00:07:11.542 --> 00:07:13.292
Whatever, you're just a quarter-demon!

00:07:13.292 --> 00:07:14.458
Hello there.

00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:16.458
What are we celebrating?

00:07:16.792 --> 00:07:20.208
Lord Riku, what business do you have today?

00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:23.458
The thing is... Oh, you're here.

00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:26.292
My dear bounty hunter.

00:07:26.292 --> 00:07:27.625
Huh? Me?

00:07:28.125 --> 00:07:30.708
How's the slaying of the Four Perils going?

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:33.875
If I remember correctly,
I left quite the hefty sum.

00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:39.000
If it were up to me, I would've gone to
slay them myself and get that bounty,

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.333
and then <i>bam</i>, my debts would be paid,
I would breathe easy...

00:07:43.333 --> 00:07:45.875
But I have no idea where they ran off to.

00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:49.625
My, I thought that might be the case.

00:07:49.958 --> 00:07:52.917
So I heard a rumor regarding Totetsu.

00:07:53.375 --> 00:07:56.500
Totetsu! The one who
goes around eating monks.

00:07:56.875 --> 00:08:00.417
That's the one.
I heard that someone saw him.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.708
If you know where he is,
then leave the rest to me.

00:08:03.708 --> 00:08:05.667
Where are the demon slayer girls?

00:08:05.667 --> 00:08:08.167
Probably in the village.
Let's go, Takechiyo.

00:08:09.167 --> 00:08:11.750
Wait, why do I have to go?

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:12.917
Go help them.

00:08:12.917 --> 00:08:14.250
Okay.

00:08:25.417 --> 00:08:28.667
The Tree of Ages
hasn't come out since then.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:38.292
She's the one who told us to slay Kirinmaru,
but I wonder if she gave up.

00:08:38.917 --> 00:08:43.917
Or maybe, since we're defeating
Kirinmaru's underlings anyway,

00:08:43.917 --> 00:08:45.667
she's just watching over us?

00:08:46.917 --> 00:08:50.458
Instead of Kirinmaru, I would much rather...

00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:03.667
There you are.

00:09:03.667 --> 00:09:05.083
Hey!

00:09:07.833 --> 00:09:11.000
Takechiyo? I wonder what's up? Huh?

00:09:11.542 --> 00:09:13.000
Why is Riku with them?

00:09:15.375 --> 00:09:18.625
We know where Totetsu is,
so let's go slay him.

00:09:19.208 --> 00:09:20.500
How did you find out?

00:09:20.875 --> 00:09:24.375
Some pirate friends of mine
gave me information.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.625
Come on, let's go.

00:09:26.625 --> 00:09:28.375
Are you fine with that?

00:09:28.375 --> 00:09:29.625
What do you mean?

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:35.458
We're getting closer to slaying Kirinmaru,
which is what the Tree of Ages wants us to do.

00:09:35.833 --> 00:09:37.958
As long as I can make money,
I'm fine with it.

00:09:38.292 --> 00:09:42.083
Instead of Kirinmaru, I want to find
the Dream Butterfly first.

00:09:42.083 --> 00:09:43.583
Oh, that's right.

00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:47.875
Lady Towa, you were looking
for the Dream Butterfly?

00:09:47.958 --> 00:09:51.958
This is also a rumor I heard
from my pirate friends,

00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:55.708
but Kirinmaru and the Dream Butterfly
are connected somehow.

00:09:56.083 --> 00:09:57.042
Really?

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.542
Well, it's only a rumor.

00:10:00.875 --> 00:10:03.292
So where is Kirinmaru?

00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:06.208
I actually still don't know.

00:10:06.708 --> 00:10:11.625
But if you keep defeating his underlings,
I think he will come out on his own.

00:10:11.625 --> 00:10:14.458
I see. Then what are we waiting for?

00:10:14.542 --> 00:10:17.458
Yeah! Big bounty, here I come!

00:10:17.875 --> 00:10:18.958
Setsuna.

00:10:35.333 --> 00:10:36.583
All right.

00:10:41.167 --> 00:10:46.333
He should be east, near the river.
I heard that's where Totetsu was last.

00:10:46.667 --> 00:10:48.875
Hurry up, Takechiyo.

00:10:49.708 --> 00:10:52.208
I've never had to carry
so many people before.

00:10:52.792 --> 00:10:55.583
Riku, why do you know about Kirinmaru?

00:10:55.583 --> 00:11:00.000
Well, it seems like he has something I want.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.417
A Rainbow Pearl?

00:11:01.542 --> 00:11:03.250
Something much more valuable.

00:11:03.917 --> 00:11:06.083
What? What kind of treasure is it?

00:11:06.958 --> 00:11:11.333
Let's just say it'll be
more fun if it's a surprise.

00:11:19.208 --> 00:11:20.125
What's going on?

00:11:20.125 --> 00:11:23.333
A virtuous monk lives in that temple there.

00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:26.792
Has Totetsu decided to show himself?

00:11:26.792 --> 00:11:28.458
Is he here to eat the monk?

00:11:28.708 --> 00:11:30.167
Hurry, Takechiyo.

00:11:33.125 --> 00:11:33.958
Hup.

00:11:37.917 --> 00:11:41.500
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – TOTETSU
I'm going to eat you! Here I go!

00:11:43.917 --> 00:11:49.750
Geez, you really don't look tasty at all.
But I'm going to eat you!

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.292
Someone help!

00:11:51.958 --> 00:11:55.083
How long do I have to do this for?

00:11:55.542 --> 00:11:59.833
I don't even want to eat
this gross-looking monk.

00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:01.458
Stop it, Totetsu!

00:12:02.625 --> 00:12:03.875
Let that monk go!

00:12:05.833 --> 00:12:09.500
You finally showed up,
you poisonous half-demons.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.792
You must be really dumb.

00:12:11.042 --> 00:12:12.125
What?

00:12:12.125 --> 00:12:15.167
Why do I have to let go of this monk?

00:12:15.625 --> 00:12:20.917
Um, because he's a hostage?
And if you don't let him go...

00:12:20.917 --> 00:12:22.958
We will cut everything without mercy.

00:12:22.958 --> 00:12:24.625
But the monk...

00:12:24.625 --> 00:12:27.875
If he gets dragged in,
luck was simply not on his side.

00:12:28.042 --> 00:12:29.458
What?!

00:12:29.667 --> 00:12:31.375
Come and get me then.

00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:32.625
Steel yourself.

00:12:32.625 --> 00:12:35.000
Setsuna, that monk...

00:12:35.542 --> 00:12:37.250
H-Help me!

00:12:45.333 --> 00:12:46.208
What?

00:12:48.458 --> 00:12:50.167
H-Help me!

00:12:58.333 --> 00:12:59.375
What?

00:13:01.583 --> 00:13:02.583
Moroha!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.333
What's going on?

00:13:31.667 --> 00:13:33.250
Get back here!

00:13:33.875 --> 00:13:36.292
Takechiyo, don't just stand there! Let's go!

00:13:36.458 --> 00:13:38.250
You're working me too hard!

00:13:38.625 --> 00:13:40.500
Towa, Setsuna, jump on.

00:13:41.458 --> 00:13:43.875
Okay, hang on tight!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.667
Was I saved?

00:13:48.167 --> 00:13:49.958
Catch me if you can!

00:13:49.958 --> 00:13:52.167
Come back here!

00:14:09.083 --> 00:14:10.125
Takechiyo!

00:14:19.542 --> 00:14:20.958
Th-They disappeared.

00:14:49.917 --> 00:14:51.500
What's going on?

00:14:52.083 --> 00:14:54.083
They've entered the field.

00:14:54.083 --> 00:14:56.167
What's that?

00:14:56.167 --> 00:14:59.000
I don't even know
how this is going to turn out.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:04.250
The Rainbow Pearl will lead the way,
I suppose.

00:15:07.375 --> 00:15:10.292
I thought we were in a ravine,
but it's pretty wide.

00:15:10.792 --> 00:15:12.417
Where's Totetsu?

00:15:12.792 --> 00:15:14.375
And Moroha, too.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.125
Let's try going there first.

00:15:19.542 --> 00:15:21.333
Get back here!

00:15:23.625 --> 00:15:26.417
You're being a sore loser, Totetsu!

00:15:26.875 --> 00:15:28.708
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:15:32.083 --> 00:15:33.083
Huh?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:39.333
Was that an illusion that I just cut?

00:15:56.125 --> 00:15:58.500
Setsuna! Towa!

00:15:59.542 --> 00:16:00.875
Something's wrong.

00:16:01.458 --> 00:16:03.708
We don't seem to be getting any closer.

00:16:04.375 --> 00:16:06.958
And Moroha and Totetsu
are nowhere to be found.

00:16:08.042 --> 00:16:09.375
Moroha!

00:16:10.333 --> 00:16:11.875
Moroha!

00:16:13.458 --> 00:16:15.375
Moroha!

00:16:17.292 --> 00:16:18.875
Let's go a little further.

00:16:31.458 --> 00:16:34.500
How deep does this ravine go?

00:16:35.167 --> 00:16:38.292
Hey, it can't be this deep, right?

00:17:04.667 --> 00:17:08.250
Through the gate of opening,
trapped in the gate of surprise.

00:17:08.458 --> 00:17:12.250
And now, the two
are at the gate of rest...

00:17:13.208 --> 00:17:14.917
This is strange.

00:17:14.917 --> 00:17:19.417
Yeah. We're not getting closer at all.
Should we head back?

00:17:21.667 --> 00:17:22.917
Did we walk this far?

00:17:23.458 --> 00:17:27.333
We may have been captured
in some kind of spell.

00:17:27.625 --> 00:17:28.542
A spell?

00:17:29.333 --> 00:17:32.417
It's not just Totetsu we're after.

00:17:32.667 --> 00:17:37.292
Konton. He was someone
who used strange spells.

00:17:37.542 --> 00:17:40.208
Towa, cut me with your katana.

00:17:40.333 --> 00:17:41.375
What?

00:17:42.542 --> 00:17:44.167
I said, cut me.

00:17:44.333 --> 00:17:47.250
Why would I do that? There's no way I can.

00:17:47.667 --> 00:17:48.542
I see.

00:17:54.292 --> 00:17:55.458
Setsuna?

00:18:05.708 --> 00:18:08.708
I thought I would wake up
if this was an illusion spell,

00:18:08.792 --> 00:18:10.750
but I guess things aren't so simple.

00:18:11.083 --> 00:18:12.000
Why did you do that?!

00:18:12.583 --> 00:18:14.000
You're too soft, Towa.

00:18:14.917 --> 00:18:18.083
It's not necessarily your fault
that you lack training,

00:18:18.083 --> 00:18:23.083
but earlier, when we were fighting Totetsu,
he read your facial expression

00:18:23.083 --> 00:18:25.500
and figured out that Moroha was behind him.

00:18:25.583 --> 00:18:26.958
But...

00:18:26.958 --> 00:18:28.333
Do not underestimate this era.

00:18:32.125 --> 00:18:36.375
So, what next? If this is not
an illusion, then what is this spell?

00:18:37.292 --> 00:18:39.167
Setsuna, wait here, okay?

00:18:39.417 --> 00:18:41.625
What is it?
Are we splitting up?

00:18:42.083 --> 00:18:44.625
I'm going to use you as a guide. Don't move.

00:19:14.792 --> 00:19:16.042
How's that?

00:19:24.708 --> 00:19:26.833
What the heck is going on?

00:19:27.333 --> 00:19:28.667
But...

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.292
Damn it.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.208
This tree...

00:19:53.375 --> 00:19:55.875
But this tree was supposed to be behind me.

00:19:56.458 --> 00:19:58.542
Setsuna? Setsuna?

00:20:03.458 --> 00:20:06.542
From the gate of surprise,
to the gate of death.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:10.042
Wait, okay, calm down.

00:20:15.417 --> 00:20:17.208
I smell Setsuna's blood.

00:20:22.417 --> 00:20:27.250
Setsuna!

00:20:27.583 --> 00:20:28.667
Behind me?

00:20:28.667 --> 00:20:29.625
Setsuna!

00:20:30.125 --> 00:20:33.375
Why are you behind me?
I haven't moved at all.

00:20:33.708 --> 00:20:39.333
Konton's spell twists the space around us
and it's making us go in circles.

00:20:40.167 --> 00:20:41.292
She disappeared.

00:20:41.375 --> 00:20:42.667
It's a Möbius strip.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:43.958
A what?

00:20:43.958 --> 00:20:47.042
If we can't physically escape this trap,

00:20:47.417 --> 00:20:50.125
we just have to sever the circle itself.

00:20:50.625 --> 00:20:53.417
If you want me to cut something,
I can, but where?

00:20:53.667 --> 00:20:58.042
I don't know if we can see it,
but is there a nexus of the spell somewhere?

00:20:58.917 --> 00:21:01.042
We can if it's a rift of demon energy.

00:21:01.458 --> 00:21:02.750
What does that mean?

00:21:03.875 --> 00:21:09.917
I heard that our clan can sniff out
where rifts of demon energies clash.

00:21:09.917 --> 00:21:11.417
And we can cut through that.

00:21:12.125 --> 00:21:13.417
Sniff out?

00:21:13.958 --> 00:21:15.000
I'll try it.

00:21:31.583 --> 00:21:32.417
This smell.

00:21:32.833 --> 00:21:34.083
Konton!

00:21:50.583 --> 00:21:51.625
He's close.

00:21:51.625 --> 00:21:52.542
Yeah.

00:21:54.333 --> 00:21:55.333
What?

00:22:09.458 --> 00:22:10.667
How dare you.

00:22:10.833 --> 00:22:12.333
Disgusting.

00:23:43.042 --> 00:23:44.875
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.875 --> 00:23:46.958
We found you, Konton, prepare yourself!

00:23:47.417 --> 00:23:49.583
But where did Totetsu go?

00:23:49.583 --> 00:23:51.458
Is he planning to run to the seas?

00:23:51.792 --> 00:23:55.167
He must be running for help from
his higher-up, Kirinmaru.

00:23:55.167 --> 00:23:56.125
Higher-up?

00:23:56.125 --> 00:23:57.250
Someone above his rank.

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:59.042
Then that'd be the boss, wouldn't it?

00:23:59.042 --> 00:24:02.167
How many mon coins do you think
that Kirinmaru boss is worth?

00:24:02.167 --> 00:24:04.583
Wait, who is that?

00:24:04.792 --> 00:24:07.792
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"Sesshomaru and Kirinmaru"

00:24:08.458 --> 00:24:24.022
What? That person is Sesshomaru?
